<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed higher in active trading.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average rose 33.47 to 7687.72. For the week it fell 108.79.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite rose 2.37 to 463.30. For the week it dropped 4.54.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose $0.22.</p>
<p>Advancers beat decliners 1799 to 938.</p>
<p>Volume was 469,700,830 compared to 499,780,900 on Thursday. Weekly volume was 2,633,860,830.</p>
<p>(Prices official as of 1645 EST/2045 GMT).</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
